---
title: "US 1.0.1, 1.0.3, 1.0.4: Add User Profiles / Show history of Site Inspections on a Steward's Profile / Aggregate User Activity and Contributions on a user's profile"
config:
  theme: base
  sequence:
    actorMargin: 70
    boxMargin: 12
    diagramMarginX: 45
    diagramMarginY: 30
    messageMargin: 38
    noteMargin: 16
    mirrorActors: true
    width: 200
    height: 90
  themeVariables:
    background: "#ffffff"
    primaryColor: "#69a8ef"
    primaryBorderColor: "#333333"
    primaryTextColor: "#111111"
    actorBkg: "#69a8ef"
    actorBorder: "#333333"
    actorTextColor: "#111111"
    actorLineColor: "#555555"
    signalColor: "#333333"
    signalTextColor: "#111111"
    activationBkgColor: "#cdd3db"
    activationBorderColor: "#cdd3db"
    noteBkgColor: "#ffe344"
    noteBorderColor: "#d4ba24"
    noteTextColor: "#111111"
    labelBoxBkgColor: "#ffffff"
    labelBoxBorderColor: "#555555"
    labelTextColor: "#111111"
    loopTextColor: "#111111"
    altBackground: "#ffffff"
  themeCSS: |
    .actor-line {
      stroke-dasharray: 10 10 !important;
      stroke-width: 1.25px !important;
    }
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber off
    actor Steward
    participant Pages as Web pages<br/>HeaderDropdown menu,<br/>/detail/[namesite]
    participant Profile as Profile page<br/>(Proposed)
    participant Actions as Server actions<br/>utils/supabase/queries.ts
    participant DB as Supabase<br/>PostgreSQL

    Note over Steward,DB: Covers US 1.0.1, 1.0.3 and 1.0.4. No profile page exists in the code. All Profile page steps are Proposed.

    alt Open own profile (1.0.1 AT2)
        Steward->>Pages: Select "My Profile" in HeaderDropdown (Proposed)
        Pages->>Profile: Open profile of signed-in user
    else Open profile from a Site page (1.0.1 AT3)
        Steward->>Pages: Select the steward on a SIR on /detail/[namesite]
        Pages->>Profile: Open profile of the SIR user_id (Proposed)
    end
    activate Profile

    Profile->>Actions: getStewardProfile(userId) (Proposed)
    activate Actions
    Actions->>Actions: Check session and approved account on server (Proposed)
    Note right of Actions: Missing today: server actions use<br/>createServerSupabase, which bypasses RLS,<br/>and do no access check.

    alt No valid session or account not approved
        Actions-->>Profile: Refuse (401)
        Profile-->>Steward: Go to /login
    else Access allowed
        Actions->>DB: Read name, contact info, skills, focus areas<br/>from W26_profiles (proposed)
        activate DB
        DB-->>Actions: Profile row or no row
        deactivate DB
        alt No profile for this user
            Actions-->>Profile: Not found (404)
            Profile-->>Steward: Show "Profile not found"
        else Profile found
            Actions->>DB: Read active W26_form_responses of user_id<br/>with W26_sites-pa name and inspection_date
            activate DB
            DB-->>Actions: SIR list (1.0.3 AT1)
            deactivate DB
            Actions->>Actions: Calculate SIR count and activity totals (1.0.4)
            Actions-->>Profile: Profile, stats and SIR list
            Profile-->>Steward: Show profile, quick stats and SIR history
        end
    end
    deactivate Actions
    Note over Profile,DB: Data is read again on each load, with no cache (1.0.1 AT5).<br/>A new SIR adds 1 to the count on next load (1.0.4 AT2).

    opt Open a past SIR (1.0.3 AT2, AT3)
        Steward->>Profile: Select a SIR in the history
        Profile->>Pages: Open /detail/[namesite] at that SIR
        Pages->>Actions: getFormResponsesBySite(namesite) (exists)
        activate Actions
        Actions->>Actions: Same session check as above (Proposed)
        Actions->>DB: Read W26_form_responses and W26_answers
        activate DB
        DB-->>Actions: SIR answers
        deactivate DB
        Actions->>Actions: Remove answers listed in<br/>W26_profile_hidden_questions (Proposed)
        Actions-->>Pages: Visible answers only
        deactivate Actions
        Pages-->>Steward: Show the SIR
    end

    opt Go back (1.0.1 AT4)
        Steward->>Profile: Select Back
        Profile-->>Steward: Open previous page from navStack<br/>(handleBack pattern, NavigationTracker)
    end
    deactivate Profile

    Note over Steward,DB: Open questions: which answers count as "activities",<br/>how a steward marks answers as hidden, and whether legacy (inspectheader) SIRs count.
